In `buildFutureScheduleOccurrences`, replace the per-occurrence `isScheduleOccurrencePosted({...})` guard inside the `for (const date of getFutureOccurrenceDates(schedule, endDateObj))` loop with a single call made once per schedule, BEFORE the loop:

  const paidOccurrences = matchPostedScheduleOccurrences({
    schedule,
    scheduleId: schedule.id,
    occurrenceDates: getFutureOccurrenceDates(schedule, endDateObj),
    postedTransactions: postedByScheduleId.get(schedule.id) ?? [],
  });

then inside the loop use `if (paidOccurrences.has(date)) { continue; }`. Do NOT pass `paidByStatusDate`: the forecast has no status bit and no `dates.shift()`, so there is no coarse claim to reconcile. Swap the `isScheduleOccurrencePosted` import in the existing `#shared/schedules` import block for `matchPostedScheduleOccurrences` (keep the block alphabetical) and add no other import.
